        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions OMP3SMTSBR, Olympic Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis door handle is reminiscent of the Olympic Torch, making it a great choice for Greek inspired homes and hotels. The Olympic Door Pull is available in an 18 inch length and a 24 inch length as a surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted pull. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> for the First Impressions Olympic Series 3 Pull:\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-OMP03-specifications.pdf?v=1704262328\"><b>First Impressions OMP3SMTSBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>OMP3018SMTSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 9-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2.95\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.62\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>OMP3024SMTSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 15-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2.95\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.62\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This First Impressions door pull is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including different center to center mounting distances and  <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> <a href=\"/products/classic-madison-back-to-back-door-pull-first-impressions-pr-mds01\"><b>First Impressions Model PR-MDS01</b></a>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle).</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Olympic Door Pull",
                "description": "This door handle is reminiscent of the Olympic Torch, making it a great choice for Greek inspired homes and hotels. The Olympic Door Pull is available in an 18 inch length and a 24 inch length as a surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted pull. \r\n",
